          <h3>Lack of trust governance</h3>
          <p>
            Trust is commonly inherited from hierarchies or broad anchors rather than being selectively defined between issuing CAs.
          </p>
          <p>
            This limits fine-grained control over how trust propagates across domains and increases the risk of unintended trust relationships.
          </p>
        </article>

